"The UK declared New Zealand a separate colony in 1841 and granted limited self-government in 1852.", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "historical": false}, {"id": "enc-cia-nz-12", "text": "Different traditions of authority and land use led to a series of wars between Europeans and various Maori tribes from the 1840s to the 1870s.", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "historical": false}, {"id": "enc-cia-nz-13", "text": "Along with disease, these conflicts halved the Maori population.", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "historical": false}, {"id": "enc-cia-nz-14", "text": "In the 1890s, New Zealand initially expressed interest in joining independence talks with Australia but ultimately opted against it and changed its status to an independent dominion in 1907.", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "historical": false}, {"id": "enc-cia-nz-15", "text": "New Zealand provided more than 100,000 troops during each World War, many of whom fought as part of the Australia and New Zealand Army Corps (ANZAC).", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "historical": false}, {"id": "enc-cia-nz-16", "text": "New Zealand reaffirmed its independence in 1947 and signed the Australia, New Zealand, and US (ANZUS) Treaty in 1951.", "tier": "anchor", "state": "anchor", "trust": "trusted", "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "packet": {"schema": "FORGE-RESONANCE-PACKET/v1", "Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0, "sfe": {"Phi": 1, "eps": 0.0, "mu": 1.0}, "placed_by": "athena", "standing": "anchor", "phi_basis": "ingestion placement; factual anchor, phase Φ1"}, "concepts": ["A.NEWZEALAND"], "concept": "A.NEWZEALAND", "provenance": {"source": "cia-world-factbook", "source_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/countries/nz/", "revision": "factbook.json", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-world-factbook/about/copyright-and-contributors/", "terms": "https://www.usa.gov/government-works", "historical": false, "ingestion_note": "Sentence cut at ingestion from the CIA World Factbook. The factbook.json mirror is CC0. Recall does not segment text.", "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook"}, "contributor": "encyclopedia:cia-world-factbook", "license": "public-domain", "license_url": "https://www.cia.gov/the-worl